#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Cacti records this outcome before verifying account enabled, realm authorization, or 2FA completion; a session may not have been established."
msgstr "Cacti wuxuu diiwaangeliyaa natiijadan ka hor inta uusan xaqiijin in akoonku uu yahay La hawlgeliyay, oggolaanshaha realm-ka, ama dhammaystirka 2FA; waxaa suurtogal ah inaan fadhi la samayn."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "No current Cacti path writes this signature; recorded defensively as a possible password change with an unconfirmed outcome."
msgstr "Ma jiro waddo Cacti oo hadda ah oo qora saxeexan; waxaa si difaac ah loogu diiwaangeliyay inay tahay isbeddel suurtagal ah oo erayga sirta ah iyadoo natiijadu aan la xaqiijin."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Cacti user_log result=3 with user_id=0 may be a password change or a failed 2FA challenge; the table cannot disambiguate."
msgstr "Cacti user_log result=3 oo leh user_id=0 waxay noqon kartaa beddelaad erayga sirta ah ama tartan 2FA ah oo fashilmay; shaxdu ma kala saari karto."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Audit administration permission is required to save these settings."
msgstr "Ogolaanshaha maamulka hantidhawrka ayaa loo baahan yahay si loo keydiyo dejintan."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Authentication auditing was not enabled. Run the audit_auth_indexes.php CLI maintenance command first."
msgstr "Hantidhawrka xaqiijinta lama hawlgelin. Marka hore socodsii amarka dayactirka CLI ee audit_auth_indexes.php."

